The code was written for SigmaM2M, a oneM2M platform, from the OpenADR
specifications (PROVENANCE.md). It contains no code from other
projects. The source files that come from SigmaM2M (sim/vensim/vensim.go,
sim/vtnsim/vtnsim.go, sim/oadr3sim/sim.go) carry no per-file copyright
header, the convention of the code they come from; the copyright line
